<title>FRANCE: AIR has American Eagle order for $200 mln.</title>
<headline>AIR has American Eagle order for $200 mln.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The AIR regional plane consortium said on Wednesday it had received an order for 12 ATR-72-210A planes by American Airlines domestic unit American Eagle worth over $200 million.</p>
<p>AIR is a consortium of Aerospatiale, Alenia and British Aerospace Plc.</p>
</text>
